}

### Get System Test Summary (Metrics & Scenarios)
# @name getSystemTestSummary
GET {{baseUrl}}/coverage/cmsi9ylbz001h0vpkt76dvghn/system/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### System evidence assessment (requires migration and enabled evidence flags)
@assessmentSnapshotId = replace-with-owned-snapshot-id
@assessmentToken = replace-with-session-token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/coverage/{{assessmentSnapshotId}}/system/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{assessmentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testFiles": ["tests/system/app.spec.js"],
  "runner": "playwright",
  "executionMode": "full",
  "repeatRuns": 2,
  "coverageScope": {
    "frontend": {"root": "client", "sourceDirectory": "src"},
    "backend": {"root": "server", "sourceDirectory": "src"}
  }
}

### Evidence capabilities: enabled flags and verified support are separate
GET http://localhost:5000/api/coverage/{{assessmentSnapshotId}}/system/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{assessmentToken}}
